    "summary": "Use it in your Command phase, right after completing a Contract under the [Murderous Agenda](vsdata:ability/drukhari.kabalite-cartel.murderous-agenda) rule, and choose your **ARCHON WARLORD**. Then:\n\n1. Pick a new Contract from that rule's list; it may be one you already completed.\n2. Pick 1 enemy unit on the battlefield that fits the Contract description of that new Contract.\n\nUntil the new Contract is completed, the chosen enemy unit counts as your Contract unit and [Murderous Agenda](vsdata:ability/drukhari.kabalite-cartel.murderous-agenda) works as normal.",
